WEBVTT

00:34.290 --> 00:39.259
Lord Jaralis, our supply lines have been cut,
and reinforcements are not expected.

00:39.260 --> 00:41.440
I'm sorry for saying this, but...

00:44.460 --> 00:46.050
I guess this is it, huh...

01:12.810 --> 01:15.429
Lord Jaralis, give the order to retreat!

01:15.430 --> 01:16.950
Lord Jaralis!

01:21.020 --> 01:24.650
This is the moment to test your strength!

01:25.210 --> 01:28.239
If our regular army falls here,

01:28.240 --> 01:31.740
the rebel forces will march
all the way to the royal castle!

01:33.790 --> 01:37.120
We are fighting for our comrades!
For the unification of our homeland!

01:37.430 --> 01:42.100
You must hold the line as
the rearguard and stop the enemy!

01:42.700 --> 01:43.880
Stand!

01:47.270 --> 01:50.850
All units! Charge!

01:56.360 --> 01:59.019
That should at least
buy me some time.

01:59.020 --> 02:02.109
As long as I survive,
there's still a chance to turn the tide.

02:02.110 --> 02:04.980
It's Lord Tiran!
Lord Tiran's reinforcements are here!

02:11.710 --> 02:15.730
Do not falter! Now is the time
to show the pride of Siltvelt!

02:17.650 --> 02:19.180
Tiran...

02:32.780 --> 02:35.310
Those damnable eyes...

02:43.310 --> 02:47.110
THE RISING OF THE SHIELD HERO SEASON 4

04:06.600 --> 04:10.980
EPISODE 4: THE ENTRUSTED POWER

04:20.660 --> 04:24.079
He must have been one of those belligerent
types when he saw the way Atla moved.

04:24.080 --> 04:28.160
It's frustrating that all we can do
is just watch over them.

04:31.300 --> 04:33.590
For now, we can only entrust
everything to those two.

04:41.380 --> 04:43.220
You brat...!

04:50.810 --> 04:53.960
You mustn't show an opening in a duel!

04:55.400 --> 04:57.110
I have no openings whatsoever!

05:03.810 --> 05:06.199
He moves fast, but his fists are light...

05:06.200 --> 05:07.490
With this...

05:17.550 --> 05:20.970
Did you really think
you could defeat me, brat?!

05:33.630 --> 05:37.440
Is that all you've got?
In the end, you're just a half-breed.

05:46.420 --> 05:48.330
Are you okay there, big brother?

05:48.700 --> 05:52.790
Yeah. This is nothing compared to
my training back at the village.

06:14.270 --> 06:16.979
Oh? Still not down?

06:16.980 --> 06:18.980
You're tougher than I expected.

06:21.430 --> 06:25.770
It's been a long time since anyone
has made my blood boil like this.

06:26.160 --> 06:27.450
Interesting.

06:28.050 --> 06:29.290
More!

06:29.670 --> 06:31.699
Entertain me even more!

06:31.700 --> 06:34.979
Lord Rikeras! Grant us victory!

06:34.980 --> 06:38.209
Lord Jaralis! Deliver judgment upon
that tainted blood Hakuko!

06:38.210 --> 06:41.469
Filo, we can't lose either!

06:41.470 --> 06:42.360
Yeah!

06:43.590 --> 06:47.070
Go, Atla! You can do it!

06:48.020 --> 06:53.130
Fohl! If you win, I will give you
plenty of head pats!

06:56.830 --> 06:57.810
My...

06:58.610 --> 07:03.219
Big brother, once I'm done here,
I'll switch with you right away.

07:03.220 --> 07:05.660
I'll finish this before that happens!

07:06.590 --> 07:13.370
Those siblings fight just like
Tiran did in his prime.

07:15.830 --> 07:19.790
Indeed. That boy resembles him greatly.

07:20.360 --> 07:22.760
Who's this Tiran guy, anyway?

07:23.230 --> 07:26.930
He is Lady Atla and Lord Fohl's father.

07:29.510 --> 07:31.049
Their father?

07:31.050 --> 07:31.849
Yes.

07:31.850 --> 07:37.949
Their father, Tiran, was the son of Tyran,
the king of the Hakuko race

07:37.950 --> 07:41.320
who held immense power in Siltvelt.

07:43.310 --> 07:46.609
Though Tiran possessed talent
surpassing that of the late king,

07:46.610 --> 07:50.320
he was a man who sought to avoid
conflict as much as possible.

07:51.730 --> 07:57.750
Because of this,
he clashed with the king and was disowned.

08:07.150 --> 08:10.739
After Tyran's death,
civil wars broke out all over the country,

08:10.740 --> 08:17.350
and it's said that Tiran and Jaralis fought
together to suppress the rebel forces.

08:25.400 --> 08:26.700
I won't let you escape.

08:42.320 --> 08:46.780
I've struck your vital point, so you won't be
able to muster your strength for a while.

08:49.720 --> 08:51.680
Not yet!

08:55.020 --> 08:59.599
As expected of a legendary warrior.
You won't let me win so easily, will you?

08:59.600 --> 09:04.729
Your lofty sense of composure
reminds me of that man's spirit!

09:04.730 --> 09:08.149
Rikeras! Why are you
struggling against that girl?!

09:08.150 --> 09:10.200
Eyes on me!

09:11.640 --> 09:13.180
You...!

09:15.690 --> 09:17.830
Don't get cocky!

09:22.460 --> 09:26.700
Rikeras! Finish her off already
and come help me!

09:27.630 --> 09:29.889
Hey! Rikeras!

09:29.890 --> 09:31.300
Getting desperate, huh?

09:32.510 --> 09:38.610
When you can't win through dirty tricks,
now you're relying on others?

09:39.740 --> 09:42.870
Just so there's no room for excuses,
I'll confirm it here and now.

09:43.840 --> 09:47.939
If you lose, you'll follow any order I give.

09:47.940 --> 09:50.130
That condition still stands, right?

09:51.650 --> 09:59.619
Rest assured. No one can overturn
an agreement made in the sacred duel.

09:59.620 --> 10:03.720
Then you'll have to prepare us
a ship to Q'ten Lo like you promised.

10:05.430 --> 10:07.690
Is that clear, everyone?

10:09.800 --> 10:10.970
Jaralis!

10:12.010 --> 10:14.840
Don't forget our deal either!

10:18.900 --> 10:21.310
It's about time to end this.

10:22.160 --> 10:27.160
Very well, then I'll put
everything I have into this strike.

10:33.930 --> 10:35.370
Secret Technique!

10:36.120 --> 10:38.620
Stampede of the Iron Bull!

10:45.650 --> 10:48.040
My own imitation of
the Hengen Muso Secret Technique...

10:55.190 --> 10:56.010
...Bead!

11:00.430 --> 11:01.840
Well fought...

11:02.510 --> 11:05.850
Truly... the rightful heir of Tiran...

11:11.890 --> 11:14.840
You fought well, father...

11:21.720 --> 11:24.369
Hengen Muso Style Fist Technique...

11:24.370 --> 11:26.060
Tiger Slayer!

11:29.750 --> 11:30.420
Lord Fohl!

11:30.740 --> 11:33.310
It looks like he's in a lot of pain!

11:35.590 --> 11:37.789
ANTIDOTE USED

11:37.790 --> 11:39.050
BLUE EGGU SHIELD
Poison?!

11:42.290 --> 11:44.870
Looks like it's finally taking effect.

11:45.850 --> 11:47.659
How cowardly!

11:47.660 --> 11:49.519
Hey, that's against the rules, right?!

11:49.520 --> 11:56.069
No. In Siltvelt's duels, the one left
standing at the end is the winner.

11:56.070 --> 11:58.949
By the rules, there is no issue.

11:58.950 --> 12:00.859
There's a huge issue!

12:00.860 --> 12:02.180
Shield Hero!

12:03.450 --> 12:07.490
Don't worry... I can still fight!

12:08.580 --> 12:12.109
Big brother, please rest.
I'll take your place...

12:12.110 --> 12:13.300
Atla!

12:14.210 --> 12:15.510
I'll be the one to defeat him!

12:16.630 --> 12:20.610
I have to win if I want to hear
the truth about our father!

12:21.550 --> 12:23.390
There's nothing to hear.

12:23.720 --> 12:28.269
Tiran was a disgrace to Siltvelt,
who fled the battlefield out of fear for his life.

12:28.270 --> 12:30.479
That's not true!
Father wasn't a coward!

12:30.480 --> 12:33.009
He was a coward!

12:33.010 --> 12:34.689
He used his men as shields...

12:34.690 --> 12:37.949
...and tried to survive all by himself!

12:37.950 --> 12:39.169
Lies!

12:39.170 --> 12:42.740
He was no true warrior.

12:43.490 --> 12:48.369
He begged for his life
and died a pathetic death.

12:48.370 --> 12:51.790
Shut up!

12:53.250 --> 12:55.239
What's with this brat...?!

12:55.240 --> 12:57.509
He was on the verge of death
just moments ago...!

12:57.510 --> 13:00.970
Lies, lies, all lies!

13:01.590 --> 13:02.470
Tiran?!

13:12.440 --> 13:13.560
Take it back!

13:14.220 --> 13:17.630
My father wasn't a coward!

13:25.310 --> 13:27.540
If you want to know so badly,

13:27.840 --> 13:29.460
then I'll tell you...

13:30.500 --> 13:34.089
...the truth about his final moment.

13:34.090 --> 13:38.069
THE RISING OF THE SHIELD HERO SEASON 4

13:38.070 --> 13:43.570
That accursed Third Rebellion
Suppression War...

13:45.750 --> 13:47.780
The battle where Father died...

13:49.940 --> 13:52.849
If only that fool hadn't interfered,

13:52.850 --> 13:57.880
my plan would have succeeded.

13:58.670 --> 13:59.850
But no,

14:00.320 --> 14:05.030
he just happened to show up as reinforcements
and strutted around like a hero!

14:17.340 --> 14:22.560
Again and again, he stole the glory
that should have been mine!

14:24.570 --> 14:31.300
Do you even know how much humiliation
I suffered because of him?!

14:31.930 --> 14:34.979
He was an eyesore to the bitter end.

14:34.980 --> 14:36.110
That's why...

14:36.870 --> 14:38.070
No way...

14:53.250 --> 14:54.499
You...!

14:54.500 --> 14:59.460
That's right!
I killed him with my own hands!

15:03.880 --> 15:08.890
Lucia... Fohl... Atla...

15:18.650 --> 15:24.359
The feeling of taking his life
was the best I've ever known!

15:24.360 --> 15:28.320
I'll never forget that pitiful look
on his face in his final moments!

15:28.950 --> 15:32.790
Why is he suddenly confessing like that?

15:35.140 --> 15:38.869
Ah, that face! Yes, that face!

15:38.870 --> 15:41.500
You look just like your father!

15:41.900 --> 15:46.260
You and your old man are truly
delightful entertainment for me!

15:46.660 --> 15:47.790
Shut up...

15:48.800 --> 15:50.150
You disgusting bastard!

16:09.360 --> 16:11.620
That's... Beast transformation!

16:12.040 --> 16:12.950
Beast transformation?

16:13.430 --> 16:17.790
Yes. In Siltvelt, there is an ancient legend.

16:18.230 --> 16:21.750
Just as demi-humans can transform into
therianthropes to enhance their abilities,

16:22.100 --> 16:26.090
it is said that demi-humans themselves can
undergo an even greater transformation.

16:26.640 --> 16:28.970
Are you saying he actually did it?

16:32.070 --> 16:33.390
Most likely.

16:41.050 --> 16:44.939
My body is surging with power!
It is more than I imagined!

16:44.940 --> 16:49.919
With this strength,
there's no need for the Shield Hero!

16:49.920 --> 16:53.680
The world will worship me as a god!

16:59.860 --> 17:01.670
He's overcome the poison?!

17:12.890 --> 17:14.370
Shooting Star Shield!

17:16.300 --> 17:18.540
Elder, Lord Werner, over here!

17:29.800 --> 17:32.340
I've made a promise with Father...

17:38.980 --> 17:43.930
Fohl, while I'm gone,
take care of Mother and Atla.

18:00.480 --> 18:04.230
Yes, I'll protect them.
I promise!

18:20.080 --> 18:21.460
Back then...

18:24.960 --> 18:26.420
I was so weak...

18:39.830 --> 18:41.500
I couldn't do anything...

18:52.260 --> 18:53.900
I couldn't...

19:01.880 --> 19:03.430
...protect Mother...

19:49.440 --> 19:52.550
That little girl is next!

19:58.110 --> 20:00.000
Atla...!

20:05.480 --> 20:08.939
Die miserably just like your father!

20:08.940 --> 20:09.809
Fohl!

20:09.810 --> 20:11.310
Big brother!

20:37.150 --> 20:38.600
That form...

20:49.090 --> 20:53.199
My, my, Fohl has become
so much more manly.

20:53.200 --> 20:55.380
A white tiger!

20:56.810 --> 20:58.029
Master Naofumi!

20:58.030 --> 20:58.859
BLUE EGGU SHIELD

20:58.860 --> 21:01.599
BLUE EGGU SHIELD
All his stats are increased.

21:01.600 --> 21:02.490
BLUE EGGU SHIELD

21:03.100 --> 21:05.220
It must be the boost
from beast transformation!

21:08.950 --> 21:15.130
Damn you! Are you going
to get in my way too?!

21:26.880 --> 21:28.849
Is he going to destroy everything?!

21:28.850 --> 21:31.479
Raphtalia! Filo! Sadeena!

21:31.480 --> 21:32.479
Yes!

21:32.480 --> 21:34.019
Aight!

21:34.020 --> 21:36.160
Finally it's my turn!

21:39.050 --> 21:40.080
Let's go!

21:44.600 --> 21:46.770
Fohl...

21:53.660 --> 21:54.960
Big brother...

21:57.470 --> 21:58.750
Watch me...

22:01.200 --> 22:02.160
...everyone.

23:36.230 --> 23:40.900
#5 HAKUKO
